Package: arcstat
Type: Package
Title: Arc-Length Statistics, Equivalence Families and Induction Curves
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("M. Theodor", "Loots", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "theo.loots@gmail.com",
                    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7722-3913"))
Description: Inference from the arc length of statistical functions, and the curves of the
    induction-period standards. A goodness-of-fit test based on the arc length of the probability
    plot with an analytic saddlepoint null; distributions built from the arc length of their defining
    curve, estimated by L-moments; the characteristic-function arc length; a Bayesian nonparametric
    arc-length test; the equivalence families of the four-parameter kappa distribution of Hosking
    (1994) <doi:10.1147/rd.383.0251> and of the beta-companion family, on which the two standard
    induction-period readings coincide; and batched fits, bootstraps and permutation tests of
    induction curves. One pure-C back-end, parallel by 'OpenMP', serves this package and the 'Python'
    package 'arcstat'.
URL: https://github.com/mtloots/arcstat
BugReports: https://github.com/mtloots/arcstat/issues
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-GB
